---
import Shell from '../../../../../../components/AeroEvidenceShell.astro';
const base = '/demos/aero/heat-exchanger-hx-02b/';
---
<Shell title="Aero · HX-02B blind investigator handoff" description="A publication-grounded sodium/supercritical-CO2 heat-exchanger benchmark stopped before prediction freeze when required visible inputs remained unresolved." path="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/hx-02b/">
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">AERO / HX-02B · BLIND INVESTIGATOR</p>
    <span class="status failed">BLOCKED PENDING PROPERTY RUNTIME</span>
    <h1>The benchmark stopped before it could invent an answer.</h1>
    <p>GPT-5.6 Luna received only the frozen visible packet and selected an analytical-only path. The operating point, idealized measurement planes, and parametric area convention are now explicit; the sealed experimental reference remains closed while the independent supercritical-CO2 property runtime is still unavailable.</p>
    <div class="links"><a class="primary" href={base + 'HX02B_BLIND_STATUS.md'}>Read the public stop report</a><a href={base + 'status.json'}>Machine-readable status</a></div>
  </header>
  <section class="boundary" aria-labelledby="boundary-heading"><h2 id="boundary-heading">Why it stopped</h2><p>The visible-input conventions are resolved in a new continuation stage. The remaining gate is an independently sourced, versioned sodium/supercritical-CO2 property runtime with a validity check. Supplying guessed supercritical-CO2 properties would break the blind protocol.</p></section>
  <section aria-labelledby="scope-heading"><h2 id="scope-heading">What remains in scope</h2><div class="cards"><article><h3>Scored observables</h3><p>Hot and cold outlet temperature, two-side heat duty, energy closure, and overall U.</p></article><article><h3>Selected fidelity</h3><p><code>ANALYTICAL_ONLY</code>. No CFD, CHT, pressure-drop scoring, FEA, or CFD→FEA coupling was authorized.</p></article><article><h3>Evidence state</h3><p>No solver dispatch, no blind prediction freeze, no experimental reveal, and no validation claim.</p></article></div></section>
  <section><h2>Next legitimate action</h2><p>Provide the independent property runtime and record its version/hash and validity range. This record stays immutable and the sealed truth stays unpublished until a complete blind prediction package exists.</p></section>
</Shell>
<style>
  .status{display:inline-block;border:1px solid currentColor;padding:5px 9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.failed{color:#c84749}.links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:13px 20px;margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.primary{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);padding:10px 14px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.cards article{border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);padding:22px}.boundary{padding:20px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:var(--surface)}@media(max-width:740px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
